# Whitelist-based ignore: this workspace also holds experiment scratch,
# build outputs, logs, and model/data artifacts. Only the Kraken project
# itself is tracked.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/CMakeLists.txt
!/README.md
!/more-info.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/PENDING-TO-DO.md
!/include/
!/src/
!/tests/
!/scripts/
!/tools/
!/docs/
!/palcfg/
# Patches carried against sibling projects (npuxl), applied by hand.
!/patches/

# Python bytecode from the tools/ helpers.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Docs: keep the written docs, drop probe transcripts
/docs/*
!/docs/*.md

# Shareable performance evidence: per-op traces, baseline runs, results.
# This repeats /docs/* so the traces whitelist sits after it; without the
# repeat the earlier !/docs/*.md is overridden and every new doc is ignored.
/docs/*
!/docs/*.md
!/docs/traces/
!/docs/traces/**

# Model weights. Never in the repo: one file is bigger than the whole packfile
# budget, GitHub refuses anything over 100 MB outright (so a push that includes
# one is a push that never finishes), and the Drive connector stages downloads
# in google_drive/ inside whatever directory it is called from -- which is this
# checkout. Weights live outside the tree, in ../models.
*.gguf
*.ggml
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.pth
*.npz
google_drive/
models/
